          <p style="margin-bottom:18px;">Support the club's service work, make a memorial donation, or ask about foundation giving. Contact the club directly to start.</p>
          <a href="mailto:sec@winvakiw.org?subject=Donation%20Question" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm">Ask About Donating</a>
