          <p style="margin-bottom:18px;">Public contacts are the president, PR chair, and secretary. Full officer and committee rosters can be added once confirmed.</p>
          <a href="/contact/" class="btn btn-outline-blue btn-sm">View Contacts</a>
        </article>
        <article id="forms-brochure" class="accent-card reveal reveal-d2">
          <div class="accent-icon" style="background:rgba(255,209,0,0.18); color:var(--kw-gold-dark);"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/></svg></div>
          <h3>Application &amp; Brochure</h3>
          <p style="margin-bottom:18px;">An online application and printable brochure can be published once approved. For now, visit a Wednesday meeting or email the president.</p>
          <a href="/join/" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm">How to Join</a>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

